### Reading a written message — GET /api/v1/messages/{id}
# One text the signed-in person filed, as it now stands, named by the id filing it answered. Once its state is DONE
# the answer also carries its outcome and the days its entries were stored on. Needs an open session; no CSRF
# token, since it is a read.

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie a sign-in response sets — see ../session/sign-in.http.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here

### A message of the signed-in person's own, named by its id.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/messages/42
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}
